<section class="hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Our activities</span>
<h1>Turning shared ambitions into collective action</h1>
<p>The Data Stewardship in Germany (DSG) Community connects people, expertise, and initiatives to strengthen data stewardship as a recognised profession and a strategic pillar of research.</p>
<p>Our activities support professional exchange, collaboration, and collective advocacy across institutional and disciplinary boundaries.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><h2>What We Do</h2>
<div class="card-grid">
<article class="card"><h3>Connect and Exchange</h3><h4>Building connections across the community</h4><p>We create opportunities for data stewards and related professionals to meet, share experiences, discuss common challenges, and learn from one another.</p><p>Through community meetings, workshops, and informal exchanges, we foster collaboration and mutual support across institutions and networks.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Collaborate and Develop</h3><h4>Transforming shared challenges into collective initiatives</h4><p>We encourage members to work together on common priorities, exchange good practices, and develop ideas and initiatives that strengthen the profession.</p><p>Our collaborative activities bring together different perspectives and expertise to address challenges that extend beyond individual institutions.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Advocate and Represent</h3><h4>Strengthening the collective voice of Data Stewardship</h4><p>We promote the recognition of data stewardship as an essential profession and advocate for its integration into institutional strategies, policies, and research governance.</p><p>By engaging with research institutions, funders, policymakers, and related networks, we seek to bring the perspectives of data stewards into relevant discussions and decision-making processes.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Build Partnerships</h3><h4>Connecting communities and stakeholders</h4><p>We foster relationships with national and international initiatives, professional networks, and organisations working towards trustworthy, sustainable, and FAIR research.</p><p>These connections support knowledge exchange, coordination, and a stronger collective voice across the research landscape.</p></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section section-soft"><div class="container"><h2>How We Work Together</h2>
<p>Our activities are shaped by the interests, expertise, and voluntary contributions of community members.</p>
<p>Working groups, collaborative initiatives, events, and partnerships provide flexible ways to pursue shared priorities and respond to emerging needs.</p>
<p>The specific activities and formats may evolve as the community grows.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><h2>Get Involved</h2><h3>Contribute your expertise and ideas</h3>
<p>Whether you want to exchange experiences, collaborate on an initiative, contribute to a discussion, or help advance the profession, there are many ways to participate.</p>
<p>Together, we can strengthen the community and shape the future of data stewardship in Germany.</p>
